diff --git a/features/todomvc.feature b/features/todomvc.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..cdbd40c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/todomvc.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,195 @@
+Feature: TodoMVC
+  As a user managing tasks
+  I want a single-page todo application
+  So that I can track, complete, and organise my work
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Scenario: No todos hides the main section and footer
+    Then the main section is not visible
+    And the footer is not visible
+
+  Scenario: Adding a new todo by pressing Enter
+    When the user types "Buy milk" in the new-todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list contains 1 item
+    And the todo at position 1 has title "Buy milk"
+    And the todo at position 1 is not completed
+    And the new-todo input is empty
+
+  Scenario: Empty or whitespace input is not added
+    When the user types "   " in the new-todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list contains 0 items
+
+  Scenario: The new-todo input is focused on load
+    Then the new-todo input has focus
+
+  Scenario: Mark all todos as complete
+    Given the user has added todos "Buy milk" and "Walk the dog"
+    When the user toggles the mark-all checkbox
+    Then the todo at position 1 is completed
+    And the todo at position 2 is completed
+    And the mark-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Unmark all todos via mark-all checkbox
+    Given the user has added todos "Buy milk" and "Walk the dog"
+    When the user toggles the mark-all checkbox
+    And the user toggles the mark-all checkbox
+    Then the todo at position 1 is not completed
+    And the todo at position 2 is not completed
+    And the mark-all checkbox is not checked
+
+  Scenario: Mark-all reflects individual todo states
+    Given the user has added todos "Buy milk" and "Walk the dog"
+    When the user completes the todo at position 1
+    Then the mark-all checkbox is not checked
+    When the user completes the todo at position 2
+    Then the mark-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Toggle a single todo complete
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    When the user completes the todo at position 1
+    Then the todo at position 1 is completed
+
+  Scenario: Toggle a completed todo back to active
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    When the user completes the todo at position 1
+    And the user completes the todo at position 1
+    Then the todo at position 1 is not completed
+
+  Scenario: Double-click enters editing mode
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    When the user double-clicks the todo at position 1
+    Then the todo at position 1 is in editing mode
+    And the edit input at position 1 has value "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: Editing saves on Enter
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    When the user double-clicks the todo at position 1
+    And the user types "Buy bread" in the edit input at position 1 and presses Enter
+    Then the todo at position 1 has title "Buy bread"
+    And the todo at position 1 is not in editing mode
+
+  Scenario: Editing saves on blur
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    When the user double-clicks the todo at position 1
+    And the user types "Buy bread" in the edit input at position 1 and blurs
+    Then the todo at position 1 has title "Buy bread"
+    And the todo at position 1 is not in editing mode
+
+  Scenario: Editing discards on Escape
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    When the user double-clicks the todo at position 1
+    And the user types "Buy bread" in the edit input at position 1 and presses Escape
+    Then the todo at position 1 has title "Buy milk"
+    And the todo at position 1 is not in editing mode
+
+  Scenario: Editing with empty input destroys the todo
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    When the user double-clicks the todo at position 1
+    And the user clears the edit input at position 1 and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list contains 0 items
+
+  Scenario: Editing with whitespace-only input destroys the todo
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    When the user double-clicks the todo at position 1
+    And the user types "   " in the edit input at position 1 and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list contains 0 items
+
+  Scenario: Editing trims the input value
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    When the user double-clicks the todo at position 1
+    And the user types "  Buy bread  " in the edit input at position 1 and presses Enter
+    Then the todo at position 1 has title "Buy bread"
+
+  Scenario: Remove a todo by clicking its destroy button
+    Given the user has added todos "Buy milk" and "Walk the dog"
+    When the user clicks the destroy button on the todo at position 1
+    Then the todo list contains 1 item
+    And the todo at position 1 has title "Walk the dog"
+
+  Scenario: Counter shows correct count for active todos
+    Given the user has added todos "Buy milk" and "Walk the dog" and "Call dentist"
+    When the user completes the todo at position 1
+    Then the counter shows "2 items left"
+
+  Scenario: Counter pluralizes correctly for one item
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the counter shows "1 item left"
+
+  Scenario: Counter pluralizes correctly for zero items
+    Given the user has added todos "Buy milk" and "Walk the dog"
+    When the user completes the todo at position 1
+    And the user completes the todo at position 2
+    Then the counter shows "0 items left"
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button removes completed todos
+    Given the user has added todos "Buy milk" and "Walk the dog"
+    When the user completes the todo at position 1
+    And the user clicks the clear-completed button
+    Then the todo list contains 1 item
+    And the todo at position 1 has title "Walk the dog"
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button is hidden when no todos are completed
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the clear-completed button is not visible
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button is visible when todos are completed
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    When the user completes the todo at position 1
+    Then the clear-completed button is visible
+
+  Scenario: Filter shows all todos
+    Given the user has added todos "Buy milk" and "Walk the dog"
+    When the user completes the todo at position 1
+    And the user navigates to the "All" filter
+    Then the todo list contains 2 items
+
+  Scenario: Filter shows only active todos
+    Given the user has added todos "Buy milk" and "Walk the dog"
+    When the user completes the todo at position 1
+    And the user navigates to the "Active" filter
+    Then the todo list contains 1 item
+    And the todo at position 1 has title "Walk the dog"
+
+  Scenario: Filter shows only completed todos
+    Given the user has added todos "Buy milk" and "Walk the dog"
+    When the user completes the todo at position 1
+    And the user navigates to the "Completed" filter
+    Then the todo list contains 1 item
+    And the todo at position 1 has title "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: Active filter link is selected when viewing active todos
+    When the user navigates to the "Active" filter
+    Then the "Active" filter link is selected
+    And the "All" filter link is not selected
+    And the "Completed" filter link is not selected
+
+  Scenario: Completing a todo while on Active filter hides it immediately
+    Given the user has added todos "Buy milk" and "Walk the dog"
+    When the user navigates to the "Active" filter
+    And the user completes the todo at position 1
+    Then the todo list contains 1 item
+
+  Scenario: Completing a todo while on Completed filter shows it immediately
+    Given the user has added todos "Buy milk" and "Walk the dog"
+    When the user navigates to the "Completed" filter
+    When the user completes the todo at position 1
+    Then the todo list contains 1 item
+    And the todo at position 1 has title "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: Todos persist to localStorage
+    Given the user has added todos "Buy milk" and "Walk the dog"
+    When the user completes the todo at position 1
+    And the app is reloaded
+    Then the todo list contains 2 items
+    And the todo at position 1 has title "Buy milk"
+    And the todo at position 1 is completed
+    And the todo at position 2 has title "Walk the dog"
+    And the todo at position 2 is not completed
+
+  Scenario: Active filter persists across reload
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    When the user navigates to the "Active" filter
+    And the app is reloaded
+    Then the "Active" filter link is selected
diff --git a/watchbill.json b/watchbill.json
